  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Laplace transform of first hitting times",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "mime": "text/markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Fon = LaplaceTransformFPT[Q2, s2];\nF31 = Fon[[3, 1]][[1]];\nF41 = Fon[[4, 1]][[1]];\nF51 = Fon[[5, 1]][[1]];\n\nClearAll[Foff1on];\noffStates = {6, 1, 2};\nonStates = {5, 4, 3};\nFoff1on = LaplaceTransformToSetByState[Q2, 1, onStates, s1];\nFoffOn = Foff1on[[3]][[1]]*F31 + Foff1on[[2]][[1]]*F41 + \n   Foff1on[[1]][[1]]*F51; ",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {
    "timing": {
     "startTime": 1748475028924,
     "endTime": 1748475037743
    },
    "executionOrder": 75,
    "success": true
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Means, variances, covariance of FPTs",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "mime": "text/markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "partials1 = With[{s1 = 0, s2 = 0}, Evaluate[D[FoffOn, {s1, 1}]]];\npartials2 = With[{s1 = 0, s2 = 0}, Evaluate[D[FoffOn, {s2, 1}]]];\npartials1s1 = With[{s1 = 0, s2 = 0}, Evaluate[D[FoffOn, {s1, 2}]]];\npartials2s2 = With[{s1 = 0, s2 = 0}, Evaluate[D[FoffOn, {s2, 2}]]];\npartials1s2 = \n  With[{s1 = 0, s2 = 0}, Evaluate[D[D[FoffOn, {s2, 1}], {s1, 1}]]];\n\nmeanToffLt = -partials1;\nmeanTonLt = -partials2;\nvarToffLt = partials1s1 - meanToffLt^2;\nvarTonLt = partials2s2 - meanTonLt^2;\ncovTonToff = partials1s2 - meanToffLt*meanTonLt;\n\\[Tau] = Simplify[meanToffLt + meanTonLt, assum];\n\nClearAll[\\[Tau]fun];\n\\[Tau]fun[c_?NumericQ, c2_?NumericQ, \\[Gamma]_?NumericQ, \n   kboff_?NumericQ, kbon_?NumericQ, kuoff_?NumericQ, kuon_?NumericQ, \n   konb_?NumericQ, koffu_?NumericQ] := Evaluate[\\[Tau]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {
    "timing": {
     "startTime": 1748475037743,
     "endTime": 1748475037790
    },
    "executionOrder": 88,
    "success": true
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Joint PDF of first passage times",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "mime": "text/markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[expr1];\nClearAll[expr2];\nClearAll[exprS1];\nClearAll[exprS12];\nexpr1 = FoffOn (*/.{\\[Gamma]->2};*)\nexpr2 = Factor[expr1, Modulus -> 0];\nexprS1 = Apart[expr2, s1];  (*treat s2,parameters as constants*)\nexprS12 = Apart[exprS1, s2];\n\nClearAll[Pjoint];\nPjoint = \n  InverseLaplaceTransform[exprS12, {s1, s2}, {t1, t2}, \n   Assumptions -> assum];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wexpr\"><wgraph class=\"resizable\" style=\"width:795.6px;height:121.2px;\" aspect-ratio=\"0.152338\" tabIndex=\"-1\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" /></wgraph></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      }
     ],
     "id": "f65a296e-cab9-4b6f-a2b5-d4b17fa9e0dc"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {
    "timing": {
     "startTime": 1748475037790,
     "endTime": 1748475045296
    },
    "executionOrder": 98,
    "success": true
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Subexpression replacements to simplify integrand",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "mime": "text/markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(*Roots*)\nrootLabels = {c kboff konb^2 + c2 kboff konb^2 + c2 kboff konb kuoff +\n      c kboff konb kuoff \\[Gamma] -> C1, \n   2 c kboff konb + 2 c2 kboff konb + konb^2 + c2 kboff kuoff + \n     konb kuoff + c kboff kuoff \\[Gamma] + konb kuoff \\[Gamma] + \n     kuoff^2 \\[Gamma] -> C2,\n   c kboff + c2 kboff + 2 konb + kuoff + kuoff \\[Gamma] -> C3,\n   koffu kuon^2 \\[Gamma] -> C4,\n   c2 kbon kuon + koffu kuon + c kbon kuon \\[Gamma] + \n     koffu kuon \\[Gamma] + kuon^2 \\[Gamma] -> C5,\n   c kbon + c2 kbon + koffu + kuon + kuon \\[Gamma] -> C6,\n   Root[C1 + C2 #1 + C3 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 1] -> A1,\n   Root[C1 + C2 #1 + C3 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 2] -> A2,\n   Root[C1 + C2 #1 + C3 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 3] -> A3,\n   Root[C4 + C5 #1 + C6 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 1] -> B1,\n   Root[C4 + C5 #1 + C6 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 2] -> B2,\n   Root[C4 + C5 #1 + C6 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 3] -> B3};",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {
    "timing": {
     "startTime": 1748475045296,
     "endTime": 1748475045301
    },
    "executionOrder": 100,
    "success": true
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Integrands for bivariate Fisher information rate",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "mime": "text/markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "integrandcr = D[Pjoint, {c, 1}]^2/Pjoint;\nintegrandcw = D[Pjoint, {c2, 1}]^2/Pjoint;\nintegrandcross = D[Pjoint, {c, 1}]*D[Pjoint, {c2, 1}]/Pjoint;\n\nintegrandcrSimpl = integrandcr //. rootLabels;\nintegrandcwSimpl = integrandcw //. rootLabels;\nintegrandcrossSimpl = integrandcross //. rootLabels;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {
    "timing": {
     "startTime": 1748475045301,
     "endTime": 1748475081353
    },
    "executionOrder": 106,
    "success": true
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Compiling the integrands",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "mime": "text/markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "integrandcrCompiled = \n Compile[{{A1, _Real}, {A2, _Real}, {A3, _Real}, {B1, _Real}, {B2, \\\n_Real}, {B3, _Real}, {c, _Real}, {c2, _Real}, {\\[Gamma], _Real}, {C1, \\\n_Real}, {C2, _Real}, {C3, _Real}, {C4, _Real}, {C5, _Real}, {C6, \\\n_Real}, {kboff, _Real}, {kbon, _Real}, {kuoff, _Real}, {kuon, _Real}, \\\n{konb, _Real}, {koffu, _Real}, {t1, _Real}, {t2, _Real}},\n  Evaluate[integrandcrSimpl],\n  CompilationTarget -> \"C\",\n  RuntimeOptions -> \"Speed\"];\n  \nintegrandcwCompiled = \n Compile[{{A1, _Real}, {A2, _Real}, {A3, _Real}, {B1, _Real}, {B2, \\\n_Real}, {B3, _Real}, {c, _Real}, {c2, _Real}, {\\[Gamma], _Real}, {C1, \\\n_Real}, {C2, _Real}, {C3, _Real}, {C4, _Real}, {C5, _Real}, {C6, \\\n_Real}, {kboff, _Real}, {kbon, _Real}, {kuoff, _Real}, {kuon, _Real}, \\\n{konb, _Real}, {koffu, _Real}, {t1, _Real}, {t2, _Real}},\n  Evaluate[integrandcwSimpl],\n  CompilationTarget -> \"C\",\n  RuntimeOptions -> \"Speed\"];\n\nintegrandcrossCompiled = \n Compile[{{A1, _Real}, {A2, _Real}, {A3, _Real}, {B1, _Real}, {B2, \\\n_Real}, {B3, _Real}, {c, _Real}, {c2, _Real}, {\\[Gamma], _Real}, {C1, \\\n_Real}, {C2, _Real}, {C3, _Real}, {C4, _Real}, {C5, _Real}, {C6, \\\n_Real}, {kboff, _Real}, {kbon, _Real}, {kuoff, _Real}, {kuon, _Real}, \\\n{konb, _Real}, {koffu, _Real}, {t1, _Real}, {t2, _Real}},\n  Evaluate[integrandcrossSimpl],\n  CompilationTarget -> \"C\",\n  RuntimeOptions -> \"Speed\"];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {
    "timing": {
     "startTime": 1748475081353,
     "endTime": 1748475095791
    },
    "executionOrder": 110,
    "success": true
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Adding numerical guards before integration",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "mime": "text/markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[integrandcrNum];\nintegrandcrNum[A1_?NumericQ, A2_?NumericQ, A3_?NumericQ, B1_?NumericQ,\n    B2_?NumericQ, B3_?NumericQ, c_?NumericQ, \n   c2_?NumericQ, \\[Gamma]_?NumericQ, C1_?NumericQ, C2_?NumericQ, \n   C3_?NumericQ, C4_?NumericQ, C5_?NumericQ, C6_?NumericQ, \n   kboff_?NumericQ, kbon_?NumericQ, kuoff_?NumericQ, kuon_?NumericQ, \n   konb_?NumericQ, koffu_?NumericQ, t1_?NumericQ, t2_?NumericQ] := \n  integrandcrCompiled[N[A1], N[A2], N[A3], N[B1], N[B2], N[B3], N[c], \n   N[c2], N[\\[Gamma]], N[C1], N[C2], N[C3], N[C4], N[C5], N[C6], \n   N[kboff], N[kbon], N[kuoff], N[kuon], N[konb], N[koffu], N[t1], \n   N[t2]];\n\nClearAll[integrandcwNum];\nintegrandcwNum[A1_?NumericQ, A2_?NumericQ, A3_?NumericQ, B1_?NumericQ,\n    B2_?NumericQ, B3_?NumericQ, c_?NumericQ, \n   c2_?NumericQ, \\[Gamma]_?NumericQ, C1_?NumericQ, C2_?NumericQ, \n   C3_?NumericQ, C4_?NumericQ, C5_?NumericQ, C6_?NumericQ, \n   kboff_?NumericQ, kbon_?NumericQ, kuoff_?NumericQ, kuon_?NumericQ, \n   konb_?NumericQ, koffu_?NumericQ, t1_?NumericQ, t2_?NumericQ] := \n  integrandcwCompiled[N[A1], N[A2], N[A3], N[B1], N[B2], N[B3], N[c], \n   N[c2], N[\\[Gamma]], N[C1], N[C2], N[C3], N[C4], N[C5], N[C6], \n   N[kboff], N[kbon], N[kuoff], N[kuon], N[konb], N[koffu], N[t1], \n   N[t2]];\n\nClearAll[integrandcrossNum];\nintegrandcrossNum[A1_?NumericQ, A2_?NumericQ, A3_?NumericQ, \n   B1_?NumericQ, B2_?NumericQ, B3_?NumericQ, c_?NumericQ, \n   c2_?NumericQ, \\[Gamma]_?NumericQ, C1_?NumericQ, C2_?NumericQ, \n   C3_?NumericQ, C4_?NumericQ, C5_?NumericQ, C6_?NumericQ, \n   kboff_?NumericQ, kbon_?NumericQ, kuoff_?NumericQ, kuon_?NumericQ, \n   konb_?NumericQ, koffu_?NumericQ, t1_?NumericQ, t2_?NumericQ] := \n  integrandcrossCompiled[N[A1], N[A2], N[A3], N[B1], N[B2], N[B3], \n   N[c], N[c2], N[\\[Gamma]], N[C1], N[C2], N[C3], N[C4], N[C5], N[C6],\n    N[kboff], N[kbon], N[kuoff], N[kuon], N[konb], N[koffu], N[t1], \n   N[t2]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {
    "timing": {
     "startTime": 1748475095791,
     "endTime": 1748475095798
    },
    "executionOrder": 116,
    "success": true
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Takin' it home",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "mime": "text/markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[FisherFastcr, FisherFastcw, FisherFastcross];\nClearAll[FisherSafecr, FisherSafecw, FisherSafecross];\n\n(*kboff2,kuoff,kuon,c*kbon2,kon1b,c*kboff,c*kbon,kuoff2,kon2b,kuon2,\\\nkoffu*)\nFisherFastcr[c_?NumericQ, c2_?NumericQ, \\[Gamma]_?NumericQ, \n   kboff_?NumericQ, konb_?NumericQ, kuon_?NumericQ, kbon_?NumericQ, \n   koffu_?NumericQ, kuoff_?NumericQ] := \n  Module[{\\[Tau]eval, integral, A1, A2, A3, B1, B2, B3, C1, C2, C3, \n    C4, C5, C6},\n   \\[Tau]eval = \\[Tau]fun[c, c2, \\[Gamma], kboff, kbon, kuoff, kuon, \n     konb, koffu];\n   C1 = c kboff konb^2 + c2 kboff konb^2 + c2 kboff konb kuoff + \n     c kboff konb kuoff \\[Gamma]; \n   C2 = 2 c kboff konb + 2 c2 kboff konb + konb^2 + c2 kboff kuoff + \n     konb kuoff + c kboff kuoff \\[Gamma] + konb kuoff \\[Gamma] + \n     kuoff^2 \\[Gamma];\n   C3 = c kboff + c2 kboff + 2 konb + kuoff + kuoff \\[Gamma];\n   C4 = koffu kuon^2 \\[Gamma];\n   C5 = c2 kbon kuon + koffu kuon + c kbon kuon \\[Gamma] + \n     koffu kuon \\[Gamma] + kuon^2 \\[Gamma];\n   C6 = c kbon + c2 kbon + koffu + kuon + kuon \\[Gamma];\n   A1 = Root[C1 + C2 #1 + C3 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 1];\n   A2 = Root[C1 + C2 #1 + C3 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 2];\n   A3 = Root[C1 + C2 #1 + C3 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 3];\n   B1 = Root[C4 + C5 #1 + C6 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 1];\n   B2 = Root[C4 + C5 #1 + C6 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 2];\n   B3 = Root[C4 + C5 #1 + C6 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 3];\n   integral = \n    NIntegrate[\n     integrandcrNum[A1, A2, A3, B1, B2, B3, c, c2, \\[Gamma], C1, C2, \n      C3, C4, C5, C6, kboff, kbon, kuoff, kuon, konb, koffu, t1, \n      t2], {t1, 0, \\[Infinity]}, {t2, 0, \\[Infinity]},\n     Method -> {\"DoubleExponential\"},\n     PrecisionGoal -> 5,\n     MinRecursion -> 3,\n     MaxRecursion -> 10];\n   integral*c^2/\\[Tau]eval];\n\nFisherSafecr[pars__?NumericQ] :=\n  Quiet[\n   Check[\n    FisherFastcr[pars],\n    -1,(* \\[LeftArrow] penalty when NIntegrate fails*)\n    {NIntegrate::ncvb, NIntegrate::inumri, NIntegrate::slowcon}\n    ], {NIntegrate::ncvb, NIntegrate::inumri, NIntegrate::slowcon}\n   ];\n\n(*kboff2,kuoff,kuon,c*kbon2,kon1b,c*kboff,c*kbon,kuoff2,kon2b,kuon2,\\\nkoffu*)\nFisherFastcw[c_?NumericQ, c2_?NumericQ, \\[Gamma]_?NumericQ, \n   kboff_?NumericQ, konb_?NumericQ, kuon_?NumericQ, kbon_?NumericQ, \n   koffu_?NumericQ, kuoff_?NumericQ] := \n  Module[{\\[Tau]eval, integral, A1, A2, A3, B1, B2, B3, C1, C2, C3, \n    C4, C5, C6},\n   \\[Tau]eval = \\[Tau]fun[c, c2, \\[Gamma], kboff, kbon, kuoff, kuon, \n     konb, koffu];\n   C1 = c kboff konb^2 + c2 kboff konb^2 + c2 kboff konb kuoff + \n     c kboff konb kuoff \\[Gamma]; \n   C2 = 2 c kboff konb + 2 c2 kboff konb + konb^2 + c2 kboff kuoff + \n     konb kuoff + c kboff kuoff \\[Gamma] + konb kuoff \\[Gamma] + \n     kuoff^2 \\[Gamma];\n   C3 = c kboff + c2 kboff + 2 konb + kuoff + kuoff \\[Gamma];\n   C4 = koffu kuon^2 \\[Gamma];\n   C5 = c2 kbon kuon + koffu kuon + c kbon kuon \\[Gamma] + \n     koffu kuon \\[Gamma] + kuon^2 \\[Gamma];\n   C6 = c kbon + c2 kbon + koffu + kuon + kuon \\[Gamma];\n   A1 = Root[C1 + C2 #1 + C3 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 1];\n   A2 = Root[C1 + C2 #1 + C3 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 2];\n   A3 = Root[C1 + C2 #1 + C3 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 3];\n   B1 = Root[C4 + C5 #1 + C6 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 1];\n   B2 = Root[C4 + C5 #1 + C6 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 2];\n   B3 = Root[C4 + C5 #1 + C6 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 3];\n   integral = \n    NIntegrate[\n     integrandcwNum[A1, A2, A3, B1, B2, B3, c, c2, \\[Gamma], C1, C2, \n      C3, C4, C5, C6, kboff, kbon, kuoff, kuon, konb, koffu, t1, \n      t2], {t1, 0, \\[Infinity]}, {t2, 0, \\[Infinity]},\n     Method -> {\"DoubleExponential\"},\n     PrecisionGoal -> 5,\n     MinRecursion -> 3,\n     MaxRecursion -> 10];\n   integral*c2^2/\\[Tau]eval];\n\nFisherSafecw[pars__?NumericQ] :=\n  Quiet[\n   Check[\n    FisherFastcw[pars],\n    -1,(* \\[LeftArrow] penalty when NIntegrate fails*)\n    {NIntegrate::ncvb, NIntegrate::inumri, NIntegrate::slowcon}\n    ], {NIntegrate::ncvb, NIntegrate::inumri, NIntegrate::slowcon}\n   ];\n\n(*kboff2,kuoff,kuon,c*kbon2,kon1b,c*kboff,c*kbon,kuoff2,kon2b,kuon2,\\\nkoffu*)\nFisherFastcross[c_?NumericQ, c2_?NumericQ, \\[Gamma]_?NumericQ, \n   kboff_?NumericQ, konb_?NumericQ, kuon_?NumericQ, kbon_?NumericQ, \n   koffu_?NumericQ, kuoff_?NumericQ] := \n  Module[{\\[Tau]eval, integral, A1, A2, A3, B1, B2, B3, C1, C2, C3, \n    C4, C5, C6},\n   \\[Tau]eval = \\[Tau]fun[c, c2, \\[Gamma], kboff, kbon, kuoff, kuon, \n     konb, koffu];\n   C1 = c kboff konb^2 + c2 kboff konb^2 + c2 kboff konb kuoff + \n     c kboff konb kuoff \\[Gamma]; \n   C2 = 2 c kboff konb + 2 c2 kboff konb + konb^2 + c2 kboff kuoff + \n     konb kuoff + c kboff kuoff \\[Gamma] + konb kuoff \\[Gamma] + \n     kuoff^2 \\[Gamma];\n   C3 = c kboff + c2 kboff + 2 konb + kuoff + kuoff \\[Gamma];\n   C4 = koffu kuon^2 \\[Gamma];\n   C5 = c2 kbon kuon + koffu kuon + c kbon kuon \\[Gamma] + \n     koffu kuon \\[Gamma] + kuon^2 \\[Gamma];\n   C6 = c kbon + c2 kbon + koffu + kuon + kuon \\[Gamma];\n   A1 = Root[C1 + C2 #1 + C3 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 1];\n   A2 = Root[C1 + C2 #1 + C3 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 2];\n   A3 = Root[C1 + C2 #1 + C3 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 3];\n   B1 = Root[C4 + C5 #1 + C6 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 1];\n   B2 = Root[C4 + C5 #1 + C6 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 2];\n   B3 = Root[C4 + C5 #1 + C6 #1^2 + #1^3 &, 3];\n   integral = \n    NIntegrate[\n     integrandcrossNum[A1, A2, A3, B1, B2, B3, c, c2, \\[Gamma], C1, \n      C2, C3, C4, C5, C6, kboff, kbon, kuoff, kuon, konb, koffu, t1, \n      t2], {t1, 0, \\[Infinity]}, {t2, 0, \\[Infinity]},\n     Method -> {\"DoubleExponential\"},\n     PrecisionGoal -> 5,\n     MinRecursion -> 3,\n     MaxRecursion -> 10];\n   integral*c*c2/\\[Tau]eval];\n\nFisherSafecross[pars__?NumericQ] :=\n  Quiet[\n   Check[\n    FisherFastcross[pars],\n    -1,(* \\[LeftArrow] penalty when NIntegrate fails*)\n    {NIntegrate::ncvb, NIntegrate::inumri, NIntegrate::slowcon}\n    ], {NIntegrate::ncvb, NIntegrate::inumri, NIntegrate::slowcon}\n   ];\n",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
